Package: mosaik
Type: Package
Title: Categorical Raster Algebra for Landscape Analysis
Description: Measure and modify spatial patterns in gridded landscape
    mosaics, with the measurement primitives and their composition made
    explicit so that a new metric is an expression rather than a new
    function. Modify operators transform categorical and continuous layers,
    measure operators quantify the primitives (adjacency, area, perimeter,
    distance, dissimilarity) at patch, class, and landscape scale, and
    composite metrics are derived from equations over them. Cell values are
    group identifiers throughout, and provenance is recorded in the
    vocabulary of the W3C PROV ontology as operations are applied.
Version: 1.0.0
